[2.283726,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  Keep a gateway reachable through two failures\r\n  =============================================\r\n\r\n  Ze and keepalived share zeptrk0. VIP 203.0.113.1 belongs to VRID 12.\r\n  Keepalived has priority 100; Ze initially has no VRRP group.\r\n\r\n  We load two sections in one SSH candidate:\r\n\r\n    1. Define the shared virtual gateway\r\n    2. Lower preference when the uplink fails\r\n\r\n  Then fail the tracked uplink AND the peer, without stopping Ze.\r\n  Restore the peer first, then the uplink, and watch ownership move.\r\n"]
